    "expansion_note": "Complete list/table/turn/Q&A context may exceed requested count; original blocks unchanged.",
    "blocks": [
      {
        "block_id": "block-000086-935d6090",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/p[2]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 86,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "We operate our business and report our financial performance using three segments: Productivity and Business Processes, Intelligent Cloud, and More Personal Computing. Our segments provide management with a comprehensive financial view of our key businesses. The segments enable the alignment of strategies and objectives across the development, sales, marketing, and services organizations, and they provide a framework for timely and rational allocation of resources within businesses.",
        "text_hash": "935d60904eb39710e00cb0d07e9c8f15556ba7d4792be8f0e005e28fdcc9c92f",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000087-44aabdcd",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/p[3]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 87,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "In August 2024, we announced changes to the composition of our segments. These changes align our segments with how we currently manage our business, most notably bringing the commercial components of Microsoft 365 together in the Productivity and Business Processes segment. Beginning in fiscal year 2025, the information that our chief operating decision maker is regularly provided and reviews for purposes of allocating resources and assessing performance reflects these segment changes.",
        "text_hash": "44aabdcda6f4b04c42224b6ae75148f50a2c1113a26a3b4004de54b5f65179b4",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000088-8339c382",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/p[4]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 88,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Additional information on our operating segments and geographic and product information is contained in Note 18 – Segment Information and Geographic Data of the Notes to Financial Statements (Part II, Item 8 of this Form 10-K).",
        "text_hash": "8339c38282c50757ec1b7dc3bb8ae7c3b8a3fbf9c77033fb9762aa774543c23e",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000089-352d4c96",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/p[5]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 89,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our reportable segments are described below.",
        "text_hash": "352d4c9695094536bfaee575b0ea75367d93f89b434e0a8256c31abc3d9ce269",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000090-94a2e06c",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/p[6]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 90,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "font-weight",
            "bold"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "13.5pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "left"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Productivity and Business Processes",
        "text_hash": "94a2e06cbe413c1e0742016cfc2688049e77680cbbe06c7bdca7fa26fbcded88",
        "type": "heading_candidate"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000091-d993f813",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/p[7]",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 91,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ],
          [
            "margin-top",
            "9pt"
          ],
          [
            "text-align",
            "justify"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Our Productivity and Business Processes segment consists of products and services in our portfolio of productivity, communication, and information services, spanning a variety of devices and platforms. This segment primarily comprises:",
        "text_hash": "d993f813170ccba6b56ef55f21d23a571600f3e3997733ba6230381a8cdeb7b2",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000092-4f8865ab",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/div[1]/span",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 92,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "times new roman"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "•",
        "text_hash": "4f8865abeddbfab37520d0c56eed1bf17f37e3778e1a55e6dc54895d2ae17849",
        "type": "list_item"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000093-7018adaa",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/div[1]/div",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
        "ordinal": 93,
        "reported_page": 5,
        "source_anchor": "F_52de2956-2cf6-4683-90c8-0b4adeb07187",
        "style_signature": [
          [
            "font-family",
            "arial"
          ],
          [
            "font-size",
            "10pt"
          ]
        ],
        "table": null,
        "text": "Microsoft 365 Commercial products and cloud services, including Microsoft 365 Commercial cloud, comprising Microsoft 365 Commercial, Enterprise Mobility + Security, the cloud portion of Windows Commercial, the per-user portion of Power BI, Exchange, SharePoint, Microsoft Teams, Microsoft 365 Security and Compliance, and Microsoft 365 Copilot; and Microsoft 365 Commercial products, comprising Windows Commercial on-premises and Office licensed on-premises.",
        "text_hash": "7018adaab1771400d012d62f1d71beaaf43645407f6d794872fd87001e9c4bde",
        "type": "paragraph"
      },
      {
        "block_id": "block-000094-4f8865ab",
        "dom_path": "/html/body/div[15]/div[2]/span",
        "image_asset_id": null,
        "layout_role": null,
